  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice and Stability in the Sahel (JASS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Justice and Stability in the Sahel (JASS) programme contributes to contain conflict in Mali, using niche contributions in areas of UK comparative advantage: conflict mitigation and stabilisation. JASS works in San, Koutialla and Koulikoro in Mali to prevent the spread of violence where risk of conflict is high.</narrative>
  </description>
